## 4. Switching Hardware  
- 继电器矩阵  
- MOSFET 全桥  
- SiC 高压开关  

- Relay matrix  
- MOSFET full bridge  
- SiC high‑voltage switches  

## 5. Design Recommendations  
- 集中绕组更易切换  
- 多相绕组可降低转矩脉动  
- 低电阻线圈减少铜损  

- Concentrated windings are easier to switch  
- Multi‑phase reduces torque ripple  
- Low‑resistance coils reduce copper loss